-- KPI: Cancellation Rate (%)
-- Used in: Part 2 (O2-15). Slide 19.
-- Share of orders that contain a 'cancel order' event.
-- Numerator and denominator both use the events table.
-- Taking the denominator from the cases table gives a wrong result (about 1.9).
-- Result: 12.48%

100 * SUM(CASE WHEN "events"."ACTIVITY" = 'cancel order' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)
    / COUNT(DISTINCT "events"."CASE")
